<title>USA: Canyon Resources FY 96 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Canyon Resources FY 96 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31,</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>STATEMENT OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>	Revenue				$4,857,000    $9,006,600</p>
<p>	Net loss			   ( 7,114,900)  ( 6,143,200)</p>
<p>	Net less per share		    ( 0.21)	 ( 0.24)</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding</p>
<p>						 33,275,500    25,696,800</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net loss for fiscal 1996 includes writedowns and abandonments of $2.4 million for exploration properties.</p>
